12-Month High Performance Executive Coaching Program Overview
This executive framework helps senior leaders transition from reactive overwork, operational firefighting, and excessive stress to calm, high-leverage strategic impact.
Strategic Objectives & Program ROI
 * Executive Presence & Inner Stability: Filter out organizational noise to make rational, high-stakes decisions from a grounded operational state.
 * Emotional Regulation under Pressure: Manage physiological stress responses during organizational incidents or stakeholder conflicts, avoiding panic-driven management.
 * Leverage & Time Optimization (Pareto Principle): Identify and execute the 20% of strategic initiatives that produce 80% of business outcomes, eliminating burnout and structural overtime.
 * Clear Boundaries & Sustainable Capacity: Establish clear operational boundaries to protect executive bandwidth, energy, and personal resilience.
 * Leadership Self-Sufficiency: Develop deep self-trust, cross-functional conflict resolution, and complete independence from coaching within 12 months.
Program Structure & Investment
 * Duration: 12 Months.
 * Monthly Cadence: One 60-minute executive coaching session (strategic realignment) plus one 30-minute operational application session.
 * Between-Session Support (Optional): €280/month for asynchronous messaging (e.g., WhatsApp, Mon–Thu) for real-time leadership feedback, accountability, and habit formation.
 * Delivery Format: Hybrid—available via virtual video conferencing or on-site, tailored to executive scheduling preferences.
 * Investment: €4,700 total (structure: two installments of €2,350 with a formal 6-month progress audit).
Core Methodology & Focus Areas
 * Cognitive Restructuring & Behavioral Change: Identify and break subconscious drivers, procrastination habits, and automatic reaction patterns under high pressure.
 * Somatic Stress Management: Decouple acute business triggers from physiological stress responses to maintain cognitive clarity during high-stakes situations.
 * High-Impact Communication & Stakeholder Alignment: Utilize structured communication methodologies to manage cross-functional friction, negotiate effectively, and build psychological safety within teams.
 * Team Performance Acceleration: Move from control-oriented management to empowering autonomous, high-performing teams through enhanced empathy and trust.
Preparatory Phase
Prior to program kickoff, executives undergo two baseline assessments to establish performance metrics and growth tracks:
 * Adaptability Assessment
 * Five-Mountain Leadership Assessment: Evaluates physical resilience, mental clarity, emotional agility, strategic intuition, and integrated execution (Kokoro).